  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 601.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 601.02 Applicability. The requirements of this part shall apply to any person who seeks to remove a dam under the auspices of the department’s river restoration program.\n\nSource. #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
